    <p>Submitting a form, sending email, or attending an introductory call does not create a client relationship. Archytum may decline work based on fit, capacity, conflict, risk, or feasibility.</p>
    <h2>Engagement requirements</h2>
    <p>Services begin only after the parties approve a written scope, sign the required agreement, and complete any required payment. The agreement controls deliverables, schedule, fees, acceptance, confidentiality, intellectual property, liability, cancellation, refunds, and support.</p>
